Z||000009||Monkeyman||01-29-2000||02:51 PM||||I happen to like cheese.  Swiss Rules!  And Gouda is pretty um, good-a.  (Sorry, but I couldn't help it!)  Didn't Limberger fly across the Atlantic in the Spirit of St. Louis?  What about the Leaning Tower of Parmegian?  Maybe it's the Leaning Tower of Pizza (they make cheese specifically for that.).  I guess I could say that I'm all-American (cheese).  Somebody stop me!  Ever hear of Little Boy Blue Cheese?  I don't live in a house.  I live in a cottage (cheese).  I used to watch the "Muensters" when I was a kid.  What's the official cheese of the Ginsu knife company?  Sharp, of course!||||reg||1
